    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-03-24",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "赤毛，其音如豚。有鸟焉，其状如夸父，四翼、一目、犬尾，名曰嚣，其"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-05-54",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "又西九十里，曰夸父之山，其木多棕楠、多竹箭，其兽"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 14,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-14-17",
      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "据传夸父与蚩尤同为炎帝之裔，在黄炎斗争中，蚩尤起兵为炎帝报仇，夸父也加入此列，最后兵败被杀"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 14,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-14-17",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "凶犁土丘。应龙处南极，杀蚩尤与夸父，不得复上，故下数旱。旱而为应"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 17,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-17-13",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "。有人珥两黄蛇，把两黄蛇，名曰夸父。后土生信，信生夸父。夸父不量"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-03-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "内，烛十日而使风雨；臣雷公，役夸父，妾宓妃，妻织女，天地之间何足"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-05-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "在其东北陬，三桑、无枝在其西，夸父、耽耳在其北方，夸父弃其策，是"
    }
  ],
  "firstSeen": {
